<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2017-01-18a.340.3" speakername="Stewart McDonald" person_id="uk.org.publicwhip/person/25322" colnum="340" time="15:54:00" url="">
    <p pid="a340.3/1">Talking about not getting answers to questions, I did not get the opportunity to put my question. I was going to ask the Minister whether she would guarantee that the closures in Glasgow are not the opening salvo in a widespread closure of jobcentres across the United Kingdom, including in my constituency. It would have been nice to have had the opportunity to put that question.</p>
